<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN WOMENS WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN WOMENS WTA TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at</p>
<p>the $450,000 Womens WTA Tennis Tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Paola Suarez (Argentina) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Sandra Kloesel (Germany) 6-1 5-7</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Florencia Labat (Argentina) beat Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Mary Pierce (France) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Petra Langrova (Czech Republic) beat Francesca Lubiana (Italy) 6-3, 6-3</p>
</text>
